WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:02.986
Unit ten. Family Members!

2
00:00:04.105 --> 00:00:09.077
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.127 --> 00:00:12.727
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.777 --> 00:00:16.654
Today we learn: Family Members. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:21.467
Uncle. Say it with me. Uncle!

6
00:00:24.982 --> 00:00:28.532
Aunt. Say it with me. Aunt!

7
00:00:32.045 --> 00:00:35.378
Cousin. Say it with me. Cousin!

8
00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:42.980
Grandmother. Say it with me. Grandmother!

9
00:00:46.484 --> 00:00:50.784
Grandfather. Say it with me. Grandfather!

10
00:00:54.271 --> 00:00:57.721
Niece. Say it with me. Niece!

11
00:01:01.236 --> 00:01:04.970
Nephew. Say it with me. Nephew!

12
00:01:08.457 --> 00:01:12.758
Stepfather. Say it with me. Stepfather!

13
00:01:16.252 --> 00:01:20.535
Stepmother. Say it with me. Stepmother!

14
00:01:24.028 --> 00:01:27.695
Relative. Say it with me. Relative!

15
00:01:31.209 --> 00:01:34.409
Twin. Say it with me. Twin!

16
00:01:37.913 --> 00:01:41.846
Elder. Say it with me. Elder!

17
00:01:45.337 --> 00:01:55.479
Grammar time! possessive 's. Listen. My uncle's house is big. My cousin's name is Tom.

18
00:01:55.529 --> 00:02:02.440
Your turn. Say it with me. My uncle's house is big. My cousin's name is Tom.

19
00:02:07.338 --> 00:02:13.680
My uncle and aunt visit us with my cousin every weekend. My grandmother tells us stories.

20
00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.061
I like this story!

21
00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:21.276
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:21.326 --> 00:02:22.476
Cousin!

23
00:02:23.438 --> 00:02:28.699
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:28.749 --> 00:02:29.899
Nephew!

25
00:02:30.976 --> 00:02:40.409
Think and answer. Who is your favorite family member? Why?

26
00:02:40.459 --> 00:02:41.774
Great answer!

27
00:02:42.725 --> 00:02:45.927
This unit's value is Respect for Elders.

28
00:02:45.977 --> 00:02:48.277
I can show respect for elders every day!

29
00:02:48.967 --> 00:02:53.970
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

30
00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.754
Bye-bye, friends!

